  "stem": "The scatterplot shows the age \\(x\\), in years, and the height \\(y\\), in centimeters, of 10 children. The line of best fit has the equation \\(y = 6.4x + 76\\). One of the children is 7 years old and 124 centimeters tall. What is this child's actual height minus the height predicted by the line of best fit, in centimeters?",
