  "solution": [
    "Predicted height for \\(x = 7\\): \\(6.4(7) + 76 = 44.8 + 76 = 120.8\\) centimeters.",
    "Actual minus predicted: \\(124 - 120.8 = 3.2\\) centimeters."
  ],
  "explanation": null,
  "traps": null,
  "verify": "x = symbols('x')\npred = sympify(figure['line']).subs(x, 7)\nassert [7, 124] in figure['points']\nr = 124 - nsimplify(pred)\nassert r == Rational(16, 5)\nassert all(Rational(s) == r for s in spr_answers)",
